OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely cloudy with patchy,
OL,6,Fmainly light, rain or drizzle through
OL,7,Fthe day. Some cloud breaks perhaps
OL,8,Fallowing some limited bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells into the afternoon, though
OL,10,Fstaying cloudy and misty over the
OL,11,Fhills. Winds staying light, with
OL,12,Faverage temperatures.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloudy at first though most
OL,15,Fparts will remain dry overnight. Some
OL,16,Fcloud breaks away from the hills are
OL,17,Fpossible after midnight, though areas
OL,18,Fof fog may form where these occur.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
