OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAreas of fog will be slow to
OL,6,Fclear in many places on Monday,
OL,7,Felsewhere some bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fmay develop. Light winds and slightly
OL,9,Fbelow average temperatures.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fbut dry after early fog Tuesday slowly
OL,13,Fgiving way to breezier conditions and
OL,14,Feventual rain from the southwest,
OL,15,Fleaving Wednesday unsettled before
OL,16,Fturning drier on Thursday. Near-normal
OL,17,Ftemperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
